OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry and bright start will
OL,6,Fsoon be followed by outbreaks of rain
OL,7,Fspreading east, these becoming heavy.
OL,8,FStrengthening southerly winds with
OL,9,Fgales near the coast.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FRain soon clearing the east,
OL,12,Fthen dry for a brief time before
OL,13,Ffrequent showers arrive through the
OL,14,Fevening and overnight, turning heavy
OL,15,Fat times. Becoming windy overnight
OL,16,Fwith gales developing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
