OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FStorm Boelo brings severe
OL,6,Fgales, particularly to the coast
OL,7,Fthrough the morning and early
OL,8,Fafternoon. Frequent showers in the
OL,9,Fmorning, heavy at times, with drier
OL,10,Finterludes developing from the
OL,11,Fafternoon.
OL,12,
OL,13,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FDry
OL,14,Fand bright morning Monday, becoming
OL,15,Fbreezy with rain later. Very windy
OL,16,Fwith rain or showers on Tuesday.
OL,17,FBright spells and scattered showers on
OL,18,FWednesday, driest in the east.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
